[en.FOCUS_C04_DINER_EXPANSION]
Diner Expansion

[en.FOCUS_C04_DINER_EXPANSION_desc]
Judging from Cloudsdale’s attitude, it seems that they will accept all muffin exports from Stratusburg like a bottomless pit, just as Sky Stinger guessed. This also means that our plan to expand muffin production and drive the entire economy of Stratusburg can continue to move forward.\nHowever... Spitfire still remembers that only Sky Stinger’s name was signed in the report. Maybe she needs to confirm with Vapor Trail again whether the investment in this expansion plan is really safe and worthwhile.

[zh.FOCUS_C04_DINER_EXPANSION]
小餐馆扩建计划

[zh.FOCUS_C04_DINER_EXPANSION_desc]
就云中城的态度来看，确实如破空所猜测的那样，他们会像无底洞一样接受所有的层云堡马芬出口。这也意味着我们扩大马芬生产，带动层云堡全民经济的计划可以继续推进了。\n不过... 喷火依然记得报告中只签署了破空的名字，也许还需要再和雾轨确认一下，这项扩建计划的投资是否真的安全、值得。

